      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "QIS installed a solar pool heating system. It failed to work correctly as it pumped cold water into the pool overnight. After 3 years and various explanations as too why the system failed to work as portrayed I had the system disconnected. When the matting on the roof was removed by a professional builder he found the pipes which were screwed through the roof were not attached to the roof battens and I spent more money correcting faulty workmanship, water did leak though to the room below now have to have that ceiling and cornice repaired. Despite calls and complaints even through Dept of Fair Trading my initial outlay was not reimbursed. Therefore I cannot recommend this company. .",
